{"v":2,"catch":"《IKARI WARRIORS》與《VICTORY ROAD》製作團隊 獻上　終極時空大戰！！","desc":"《BERMUDA TRIANGLE》是SNK於1987年推出的射擊遊戲。\n駕駛時空戰艦ZIG，迎戰企圖入侵人類歷史的神秘敵人。\n從現代到過去，戰場隨時代更迭而變遷。強化戰艦性能，獲取橫跨任何時代的生存之力！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-12-04","genres":["射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9118553129f1fa5705f5555b031b9d1a12c7f5bf85b1aecd4fb461c9799dc90.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/726e1b4bbb77179656ca6d71f15458359e5fe12077ad954ed1fd102a25b99d96.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbe35e47952625f71ba439859847e90f7460e862c87ec3af142a0930f6b0f0e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f5038aba2dc1ef49c90a2f3b594d324b114f9d857fcf9564e295055e25e4565.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8aa6a10eac44338cf6986347702e14533ea7883f43832acaef571cdca2af8b05.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea9cb3f0b87fec3041770eac2ea6bac668d6721125591f7e3da0fcb9f4d86c9a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a86025af4000"}